{
 "9076": {
  "en": [
   "Within the mind, ceaselessly, a workshop forging chains.",
   "If one bond is cut, four more grow in its place.",
   "How will the burden come down? Your trouble is no simple thing—",
   "when within the heart lies the terrible weight of fear.",
   "",
   "Night's darkness lifts, true, the moment you light the lamp,",
   "but the darkness that falls in a swoon is blacker far than night.",
   "In storm and tempest, under the waves' blows, the boat may yet survive,",
   "but the greatest blow of all is the blow of that leak of yours.",
   "",
   "Strangers there are by the hundred thousand — who could drive them all away?",
   "The stranger who dwells within the house makes a stranger of the whole world.",
   "When the prison's gatekeeper leaves, is freedom found at once?",
   "You yourself, from inside, are pressing the door shut.",
   "",
   "Pressing the claim of an empty bag, at whom do you sit and rage?",
   "Only if you know how to give will you receive; you will not get it by borrowing.",
   "You rise up mad with greed and grievance; you want the fruit overnight—",
   "It is your own sword's edge that pierces your own clenched fist."
  ],
