  "en": [
   "What coward will you frighten, O darkness? All of yours is false.",
   "Is my hope only in what lies ahead? Then keep me behind, if you must.",
   "The moment you drive me far away, you only add to your own work—",
   "you will have to come down low if you cast me down below.",
   "You would test me before you take me — is that the game you will play?",
   "He who knows not your hand but knows the blow — fear clings to his heart—",
   "he who looks past your blow and sees your hand — he alone truly knows."
